{"actor":"model","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-35269","model_call":40,"attempt":1,"model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input_tokens":20328,"output_tokens":259,"total_tokens":20587,"cached_tokens":19712,"reasoning_tokens":73},"output_characters":842,"decision":{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_00_244546227#9_450581305","relevance":3,"reason":"The dedicated Marshall Plan article has an 'Advantages for the US and Europe' section and directly states that the plan created a new Europe based on open markets and free trade, allowing American exporters to enter European markets more easily than before World War II. This directly supports how the plan was expected to help American businesses.","learned":"Marshall Plan benefits to U.S. business included promoting open markets and free trade in Europe so American exporters could more easily sell in European markets."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1404","reason":"This query is producing direct evidence about American exporters, manufacturers, markets, and trade benefits from the Marshall Plan; continue to find more grade-3 sources."}}}
